            {
                "entry_id": "760e2648-6ff6-3144-92e8-ca3dca528975",
                "word": "youkou",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8eeed6a9-b9f4-4ecc-b1fb-912c6e2335f5",
                        "entry_id": "760e2648-6ff6-3144-92e8-ca3dca528975",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "yuku"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1455da1d-ff6e-3005-8969-64c661fb2634",
                        "entry_id": "760e2648-6ff6-3144-92e8-ca3dca528975",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à la catégorie des youkous. Qui partage leur façon de vivre, leurs opinions et leur manière de s'habiller."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ad75e30-be6e-44f5-a84e-849145a421e7",
                                "sense_id": "1455da1d-ff6e-3005-8969-64c661fb2634",
                                "text": "A Chaouen – nom d’origine de la ville, qui signifie « sommets » – on trouve ce qui se fait de mieux en mode youkou, même Guillaume s’y est mis : bonnets bariolés en laine, simili-ponchos-burnous, bracelets de toutes sortes, etc."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ae13ffc-87ce-499d-9db3-ad8a47b75cb1",
                                "sense_id": "1455da1d-ff6e-3005-8969-64c661fb2634",
                                "text": "Ambiance youkou très agréable!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "57d69088-8e7d-4ae4-a83e-c38a11be3aed",
                        "source_entry_id": "760e2648-6ff6-3144-92e8-ca3dca528975",
                        "source_sense_id": "1455da1d-ff6e-3005-8969-64c661fb2634",
                        "target_lang_word": "boho",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "boho",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0b2f4a3b-960c-3c51-b893-e59c2ecf110a",
                                        "entry_id": "51bf3c74-346f-3e5b-8ebb-cbbf185d54c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bohemian."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d41e2f2-0c45-499e-80f2-f2095794b1ca",
                                                "sense_id": "0b2f4a3b-960c-3c51-b893-e59c2ecf110a",
                                                "text": "After all, […] the last thing this country needs is a mannered bunch of Manhattan bohos who use textured harmonics and jingly guitars to create a carpetbagger's vision of the heartland."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62272cd3-9e78-31fb-859f-e50d85c86db4",
                                        "entry_id": "51bf3c74-346f-3e5b-8ebb-cbbf185d54c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A style of female fashion drawing on various bohemian and hippie influences, popular in the mid-2000s."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebdc4365-4113-44df-badd-b6d4ea04d06f",
                                                "sense_id": "62272cd3-9e78-31fb-859f-e50d85c86db4",
                                                "text": "In pockets of downtown Manhattan and in cities as far-flung as Miami and Los Angeles, young women in the vanguard are setting aside their trapeze and baby-doll dresses — and as often as not, their drainpipe jeans — in favor of a breezier, more audaciously colorful interpretation of boho chic."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebf2d15c-0bf4-48b9-9ac7-3540efa3c603",
                                                "sense_id": "62272cd3-9e78-31fb-859f-e50d85c86db4",
                                                "text": "“Ooh, look at that Martina McBride boho peasant blouse. 40% off. I'm about to put you 100% on.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "boho",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ec07903-a0b3-3811-8246-ab9165f1d8b5",
                                        "entry_id": "b55759c3-caea-3c08-9e0b-b24a9bad5fb5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bohemian."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b07b886-941e-437a-9c5d-d1b4fb49a30d",
                                                "sense_id": "9ec07903-a0b3-3811-8246-ab9165f1d8b5",
                                                "text": "Down in the cellar in the Boho zone / I went looking for some sweet inspiration, oh well / Just another hard time band / With Negro affectations"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d245a60a-562e-48ed-8c8c-1955b69b1293",
                                                "sense_id": "9ec07903-a0b3-3811-8246-ab9165f1d8b5",
                                                "text": "Enter Benedict Bridgerton, the boho son of the family at the centre of Netflix's much-loved series, handsomely striding into the masquerade ball."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "133bcbcb-0d2e-3875-98b7-3c40fd3d52d8",
                "word": "youkou",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "2e79b5cf-5061-4808-84e5-df7d62bbbe5d",
                        "entry_id": "133bcbcb-0d2e-3875-98b7-3c40fd3d52d8",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "youkous"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b2cf257d-3b4c-3892-bac5-d8f72d3dbf65",
                        "entry_id": "133bcbcb-0d2e-3875-98b7-3c40fd3d52d8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sociostyle regroupant des personnes généralement jeunes et cultivées, affichant leur anticonformisme. Les youkous se rassemblent autour de valeurs communes telles que la préservation de l’environnement, le respect d’autrui et des animaux."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b25af82-c357-49b9-8332-2ed0eeb01b7c",
                                "sense_id": "b2cf257d-3b4c-3892-bac5-d8f72d3dbf65",
                                "text": "Le youkou est vraiment conscient des problèmes de notre société! La mondialisation ça tue les baleines et c’est pas un youkou qui va y participer en allant manger chez McDo !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "de68f6de-ec94-4cb6-ae1d-8b21651e66c9",
                                "sense_id": "b2cf257d-3b4c-3892-bac5-d8f72d3dbf65",
                                "text": "Pour les plus blasés d'entre nous, ce microcosme (placé sous le signe du durable) prête à sourire tant tous les clichés du parfait youkou sont réunis."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "088bf043-b26f-45ed-959a-028d6c036066",
                                "sense_id": "b2cf257d-3b4c-3892-bac5-d8f72d3dbf65",
                                "text": "Ils rigolaient blindé parce qu’ils avaient un pote qui me ressemblaient à mort aparement^([sic : apparemment]) sauf que lui était métalleux et n’aimait pas les youkous et j’étais bel et bien habillé en sarouel (comme d’hab)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85a3236b-e965-43d9-8e6f-9de797f0b06a",
                                "sense_id": "b2cf257d-3b4c-3892-bac5-d8f72d3dbf65",
                                "text": "Si vous aussi vous aimez la musique de youkous en secret cette page est faite pour vous !"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
